Lock (0.532,0.494) (0.548,0.532)~ (0.560,0.562) brush=fur w0=2.5 w=9 tips=3 tipvar=0.45 spread=16 seed=13 rgb=56,46,36 dark=30,24,18 lit=98,82,62
